comments[15]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-09T07:32:16.381Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict all-status corpus of 3242 items including 2923 closed items and request-specific keyword search reviewed. No matching owner for this GitHub report. Reuse the existing parent capability and preserve closed recovery/configuration lineage."
  "2026-11-09T07:48:23.639Z","harness:codex","Negative-control evidence: new regression assertions ran against unchanged production source before the fix. The focused run failed exactly the settings-path, leading-slash source, matcher-index and strict-close-headline assertions: 4 failures and176 existing passes. Production repair preserves existing validators and sensitive input redaction."
  "2026-11-09T09:53:13.984Z","harness:codex","PR #1696 review remediation: the concise strict-close headline is independent of optional package recovery data. The immediate retry is explicitly labeled a template requiring real evidence. The existing guidance test now asserts direct placement and exactly one retry, and the real CLI preserves history on refusal."
  "2026-11-09T10:02:53.394Z","harness:codex","Large-domain review outcome: the SDK error context retains complete recovery.allowed_values, while the existing fixed JSON diagnostic ceiling can compact very large custom schemas. Text now explicitly names the complete SDK route and discloses JSON budgeting; it no longer promises that normal --output-budget controls diagnostic ceilings. A dedicated additive CLI restore contract is tracked open/unclaimed in pm-v1kspa under recovery closure, discovered from completed pm-cha95z. Default diagnostic ratchets remain intact."
  "2026-11-09T10:24:43.764Z","harness:codex","The human legal-domain formatter now has direct coverage for a 20-value domain: eight visible values, explicit 12-value omission, complete SDK discovery route and budget caveat, while the fitting JSON domain remains complete. Focused source instrumentation passes all assertions but correctly refuses whole-repository coverage because it runs only owner files; its misleading combined exit wording is separately tracked open/unclaimed in pm-qmb6h8."
  "2026-11-09T11:52:04.094Z","harness:codex","The 1000-field diagnostic regression binds the unchanged 2000-token JSON ceiling, asserts its truncation receipt, and verifies the typed SDK error context still contains every field through custom_field_999. Fitting-domain and bounded human-discovery tests remain. No diagnostic ceiling or projection contract changed."
  "2026-11-09T12:51:17.516Z","harness:codex","Second full-review regression control: the new empty/whitespace legal-domain assertion failed against prior source. Recovery now preserves exact declared strings through normalization, quotes invisible/padded values in human guidance and calculates omissions from the full domain; JSON and original context retain the exact nine-value domain. All 168 focused configuration/guidance/workflow tests pass."
  "2026-11-09T12:54:56.505Z","harness:codex","Final review instrumentation: all 263 tests across nine files pass. The changed legal-domain normalization and display branches have no uncovered markers in the full-source instrumentation report. Whole-repository thresholds correctly fail because only owner tests were selected; no complete coverage pass is claimed. Typechecks, focused ESLint, SDK surface, contracts/catalog and actionlint pass."
  "2026-11-09T14:00:00.123Z","harness:codex","Review follow-up: malformed producer domains retain usable string choices in existing next_steps with an explicit incomplete-domain notice; they are never mislabeled as a complete refusal.legal_domain or recovery.allowed_values set. The original caller context remains unchanged. A 180-value budget-binding case already preserves the complete refusal domain when it fits once, so the diagnostic ladder needs no product change. The real integration now substitutes evidence into the producer-displayed Run command and executes that text through the host shell against the sandbox tracker. All 147 focused assertions pass."
  "2026-11-09T14:08:36.245Z","harness:codex","Final refinement evidence: all 272 tests across ten files pass under source instrumentation; every changed partial-domain normalization/guidance branch has coverage. The nine-value empty-domain control and 180-value once-fitting JSON domain remain exact. Unit validation also binds the malformed-domain omission count. Source/package/example typechecks, ESLint, SDK surface (zero classified changes), contracts/catalog and credential scan pass. The SDK guide now documents partial producer guidance and the same-close evidence template. Fresh required Sentry/telemetry gate passes at 14:07 UTC with production critical/high/unresolved zero, 4.80% telemetry error rate, no missing codes and queue drained. Final hosted delivery admission remains pending."
  "2026-11-09T14:17:05.897Z","harness:codex","Post-generation packaged acceptance also passes across all nine packages through npm/npx/Bun/bunx/SDK/MCP consumers. Tracker context quality (47 assertions), graph composition, record integrity and defect evidence pass for the completed review batch. Full hosted static/coverage/native acceptance and the final bot inventory remain required before merge; the bounded local owner instrumentation is not a complete coverage claim."
  "2026-11-09T15:28:12.326Z","harness:codex","Review controls reproduce separator/newline ambiguity, inferred complete domains over malformed producer metadata and missing compact-close fallback. Legal values are quoted/escaped unless they are simple tokens; incomplete structured metadata suppresses inferred complete domains while retaining partial next steps. When compaction drops a long close retry it retains the update-then-repeat procedure, without overwriting SDK-only recovery or inventing a missing fallback. The general text omission notice now correctly says JSON recovery has its own budget. Seven intended pre-fix assertions failed; the first repaired cohort passes 279 tests. Focused lint passes after extracting the recovery merge rather than relaxing complexity."
  "2026-11-09T15:40:28.531Z","harness:codex","Final verification: all 355 instrumented assertions across thirteen files pass, and changed source lines/branches have no uncovered markers. Additional final controls preserve a short close retry under compaction, optional-recovery headlines and SDK-only instructions. Source/package/example typechecks, ESLint without suppression changes, zero-change SDK surface, contracts/catalog, actionlint and credential scanning pass. Full source coverage is still a required hosted gate; the local selected-owner coverage report correctly refuses unselected-source thresholds."
  "2026-11-09T17:02:00.216Z","harness:codex","The full-review regressions reproduced ten failures before repair, then all 138 focused and 396 expanded instrumented assertions passed. Additional direct formatter controls show that valid and empty explicitly supplied domains also need precedence over prose-derived brief/full choices and retries. Apply that same producer-precedence rule instead of limiting the fix to malformed arrays. The host will retain a truthful SDK-context route for a retry-only overflow, not invent a command or promise unlimited CLI JSON; broader CLI restoration remains under pm-v1kspa."
  "2026-11-09T19:13:06.354Z","harness:codex","Review compaction repair: four new failing-before cases reproduced lost partial-domain evidence or oversized legal-choice echoes. Guidance now retains the incomplete-domain notice through ordinary next-step slicing and compact close fallback. Whole JSON-quoted choices share a 400-byte preview budget; oversized choices are omitted with truthful counts, never shortened into different legal tokens. All 433 assertions in the 17-file source-instrumented cohort and both linked guidance/enrichment commands pass. Whole-repository exact coverage remains a required hosted check; the selected cohort correctly exits at the full-source denominator gate. Typechecks, ESLint, contracts/catalog and SDK surface (zero changes) pass."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-09T10:03:50.434Z","harness:codex",A concise refusal must keep a complete headline and place its retry once at the top. Label placeholder retries as templates and do not promise optional recovery fields or an ineffective diagnostic budget override.
